<title>USA: Piedmont to cut natgas rates 17.9 pct in NC.</title>
<headline>Piedmont to cut natgas rates 17.9 pct in NC.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piedmont Natural Gas Co said Wednesday it would cut rates 17.8 percent for its customers in North Carolina, effective March 1.</p>
<p>The average residential customer will see his or her annual bill reduced to $80.51 from $96.19.</p>
<p>The rate cut stems from a reduction in the company's wholesale cost of natural gas due to lower demand resulting from high storage levels and mild weather.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
